OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,FThe regulator's annual compliance      
OL,7,Fassessment clears the BBC on all of its
OL,8,F2025/26 licence conditions, but reveals
OL,9,Fmisreported local radio hours from the 
OL,10,Fprevious year.                         
OL,12,FOfcom has found that six BBC Local     
OL,13,FRadio stations in England failed to    
OL,14,Fmeet their quota for original, locally 
OL,15,Fmade programming in 2024/25, despite   
OL,16,Fthe BBC having reported at the time    
OL,17,Fthat all 39 of its local stations were 
OL,18,Fcompliant.                             
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14602
SC,0002
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/18
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,FThe finding is set out in the annexes  
OL,7,Fto Ofcom's Annual Report on the BBC    
OL,8,F2025 ` 2026, published on 19th November
OL,9,F2026 ` the regulator's ninth annual    
OL,10,Freport on the corporation.             
OL,12,FFor the current reporting period, 1st  
OL,13,FApril 2025 to 31st March 2026, Ofcom   
OL,14,Fconcluded that the BBC complied with   
OL,15,Fall of its Operating Licence           
OL,16,Fconditions.                            
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14603
SC,0003
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/18
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,GLOCAL RADIO BREACHES                   
OL,8,FIn July 2025, the BBC reported that all
OL,9,F39 local radio stations had met the    
OL,10,Flocally made programming quota under   
OL,11,FOperating Licence Condition 4.40.6 for 
OL,12,F2024/25, and Ofcom recorded the BBC as 
OL,13,Fcompliant on that basis.               
OL,15,FIn March 2026, Ofcom received a        
OL,16,Fcomplaint about the BBC's compliance   
OL,17,Fwith the condition.                    
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14604
SC,0004
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/18
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,FThe regulator sought further           
OL,7,Finformation on the BBC's reporting     
OL,8,Fmethodology and supporting evidence,   
OL,9,Fand raised concerns about the accuracy 
OL,10,Fof the reported figures and the        
OL,11,Ftreatment of certain programming       
OL,12,Fcounted towards the quota.             
OL,14,FFollowing a review of all 39 stations, 
OL,15,Fthe BBC acknowledged discrepancies in  
OL,16,Fits reporting and identified six       
OL,17,Fstations that had not met the          
OL,18,Frequirement: BBC Radio Norfolk, BBC    
OL,19,FRadio Essex, BBC Radio Cumbria, BBC    
OL,20,FRadio Shropshire, BBC Radio Coventry   
OL,21,Fand Warwickshire, and BBC Radio Stoke. 
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14605
SC,0005
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/18
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,FThe shortfalls ranged from 24 to 133   
OL,7,Fhours, representing between 0.5% and   
OL,8,F2.7% of the relevant annual quota.     
OL,10,FThe BBC told Ofcom the inaccuracies    
OL,11,Fresulted from shortcomings in its      
OL,12,Freporting methodology and associated   
OL,13,Fprocesses, including issues arising    
OL,14,Ffrom the implementation of Local Radio 
OL,15,FValue for All. It said it was taking   
OL,16,Fsteps to strengthen the accuracy,      
OL,17,Fmonitoring and oversight of its local  
OL,18,Fradio compliance reporting.            
OL,20,FOfcom said it takes any breach of the  
OL,21,FOperating Licence seriously.           
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14606
SC,0006
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G6/18
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,FHowever, having considered the nature  
OL,7,Fof the breaches, the BBC's             
OL,8,Facknowledgement of them and its        
OL,9,Fcommitment to strengthen its compliance
OL,10,Farrangements, the regulator decided it 
OL,11,Fwould not be appropriate or            
OL,12,Fproportionate to take enforcement      
OL,13,Faction at this time.                   
OL,15,FOfcom has instead written separately to
OL,16,Fthe BBC setting out its concerns about 
OL,17,Fthe effectiveness of its governance,   
OL,18,Fassurance and compliance reporting     
OL,19,Farrangements, and says it will continue
OL,20,Fto monitor the corporation's reporting 
OL,21,Fon the condition.                      
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
