OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G7/18
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,GANNUAL PLAN COMMITMENTS                
OL,8,FOfcom found that the BBC delivered the 
OL,9,Fmajority of its Annual Plan 2025/26    
OL,10,Fcommitments, often delivering          
OL,11,Fsignificantly more than planned. Its   
OL,12,Fanalysis did, however, identify seven  
OL,13,Fcommitments where delivery fell        
OL,14,Fsignificantly below the planned level. 
OL,16,FThe BBC explained the shortfall in all 
OL,17,Fbut one case: comedy hours on BBC      
OL,18,FiPlayer, where it had planned 2,500    
OL,19,Fhours and delivered 2,212.             
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14608
SC,0008
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G8/18
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,FWhen asked, the BBC said it had        
OL,7,Foverestimated the volume of comedy     
OL,8,Frepeats and archive it expected to     
OL,9,Fpublish, and that availability can be  
OL,10,Finfluenced by the rights it is able to 
OL,11,Fobtain. Ofcom said it was satisfied    
OL,12,Fwith that explanation.                 
OL,14,FOfcom notes that the specific          
OL,15,Fcommitments in the Annual Plan are not 
OL,16,Fenforceable under the Operating        
OL,17,FLicence, so missed targets do not in   
OL,18,Fthemselves raise compliance concerns.  
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14609
SC,0009
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G9/18
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,GPLANS FOR 2026/27                      
OL,8,FOfcom described the BBC's Annual Plan  
OL,9,F2026/27 as comprehensive and clearly   
OL,10,Fset out. It sought clarification on a  
OL,11,Fnumber of significant year-on-year     
OL,12,Fchanges in planned output, but said    
OL,13,Fnone of them raised concerns.          
OL,15,FThe largest planned reduction is in    
OL,16,Ffirst-run Irish language and Ulster    
OL,17,FScots programming on BBC Two Northern  
OL,18,FIreland, down 56%.                     
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
