OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G10/18
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,FThe BBC said it is moving its          
OL,7,FIndigenous Minority Language           
OL,8,Fcommissioning towards higher-cost,     
OL,9,Fhigher-impact content such as feature  
OL,10,Fdocumentaries and scripted programming,
OL,11,Fwhich means fewer commissions overall. 
OL,13,FPlanned comedy hours on iPlayer have   
OL,14,Fbeen scaled back to 2,000. The BBC said
OL,15,F2025/26 was the first year it had used 
OL,16,Fa changed methodology for iPlayer      
OL,17,Fforecasts, and that it had             
OL,18,Foverestimated its capacity.            
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
