CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G11/18
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,FFirst-run UK originations on BBC Three 
OL,7,Fare planned to fall by 12%, which the  
OL,8,FBBC attributed mainly to sport, as well
OL,9,Fas to the pausing of Doctor Who:       
OL,10,FUnleashed, with no new series of Doctor
OL,11,FWho in 2026/27, and to RuPaul's Drag   
OL,12,FRace: UK vs. The World being broadcast 
OL,13,Fevery other year.                      
OL,15,FBBC Four's first-run UK originations   
OL,16,Fare planned to rise by 60%, owing to   
OL,17,Fextended snooker coverage.             
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
