OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G12/18
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,FOther changes queried included a 15%   
OL,7,Freduction in first-run documentaries on
OL,8,FBBC Radio 2, an 11% increase in CBBC   
OL,9,Fprogramming on iPlayer ` including the 
OL,10,Freturn of archive titles such as Raven 
OL,11,Fand Muddle Earth ` and reductions in   
OL,12,Fnon-news programming of 13% on BBC One 
OL,13,FScotland and 11% on BBC Scotland.      
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
