OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,GOTHER OBLIGATIONS                      
OL,8,FThe BBC was found compliant with all   
OL,9,Fapplicable obligations under Schedule 3
OL,10,Fof the Framework Agreement.            
OL,12,FIndependent productions accounted for  
OL,13,F36.3% of qualifying hours across its   
OL,14,Ftelevision channels in 2025, against a 
OL,15,F25% quota, with 33.3% on BBC One and   
OL,16,F49.3% on BBC Two.                      
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14614
SC,0014
