OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 146 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G14/18
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,FThe proportion of relevant TV programme
OL,7,Fhours open to competition rose from 77%
OL,8,Fin 2024/25 to 87% in 2025/26, and the  
OL,9,FBBC says it is on track to reach the   
OL,10,F100% target by the end of 2027. In     
OL,11,Fradio it contested 62.4% of eligible   
OL,12,Fhours, against a 60% requirement.      
OL,14,FThe BBC also met all of its 2025 quotas
OL,15,Ffor subtitling, signing and audio      
OL,16,Fdescription, and Ofcom raised no       
OL,17,Fconcerns about its commercial and      
OL,18,Ftrading activities.                    
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
