OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G15/18
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,GCOMPLAINTS                             
OL,8,FOfcom noted a fall in the number of    
OL,9,Fnot-upheld complaints for which the BBC
OL,10,Fpublished its reasoning, to 169 in     
OL,11,F2025/26, and said it would discuss the 
OL,12,Fissue with the BBC over the coming     
OL,13,Fyear.                                  
OL,15,FThe annexes also include the first     
OL,16,Fresults of Ofcom's new power,          
OL,17,Fintroduced in December 2025, to review 
OL,18,Fa sample of complaints resolved by the 
OL,19,FBBC's Executive Complaints Unit that   
OL,20,Fwere not referred to the regulator.    
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
