OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,GAUDIENCE SHARE                         
OL,8,FMarket data in the annexes shows the   
OL,9,FBBC's combined share of in-home        
OL,10,Fviewing, including iPlayer, at 20% in  
OL,11,F2025 among those aged four and over,   
OL,12,Fand 8% among 16 to 34-year-olds.       
OL,13,FYouTube accounted for 18% and 30%      
OL,14,Frespectively.                          
OL,16,FThe BBC's share of all audio listening,
OL,17,Facross radio and BBC Sounds, fell from 
OL,18,F30% in 2022/23 to 25% in 2025/26.      
OL,23,EPub: 19-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
