OL,3,GNEWSCOfcom finds six BBC Local Radio   
OL,4,Cstations missed local programming quota
OL,6,FIn nations and regions TV news, the BBC
OL,7,Fheld a 65% share of viewing across the 
OL,8,FUK in 2025, ranging from 74% in Wales  
OL,9,Fto 53% in Northern Ireland.            
